  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Once the service framework has a JMS messaging service,",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "and the core repository is enabled to publish API-M and",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "other types of events, the preservation alerting",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "service can be developed to subscribe to events that",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "are of interest for preservation. The alerting service",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "can be configured to alert people, or take other",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "action, when it detects certain types of events. ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "The development of this service will be done in",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "conjunction with Rutgers under the Sun Center of",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "Excellence for Preservation with Fedora.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
